# Hanging hive (#365, D90), native 24x32 frames: rest (a paper wasp hive hanging by a stalk from a bough drawn in the
# top 5 rows; its root, the left edge, swells into a 2 px collar over rows 0-5 that lies on the bark of a Decor trunk, D122), shake1, shake2 (the D7 warning; shake2 shows stinger tips), release (the curtain), bare (the bough after a knock-down), falling (the knocked hive alone), fallen (split on the floor).
# Joint (D130, 2026-11-24): the bough's collar is the trunk's red-brown bark (1 2 3 4) and its root (columns 0-6) ramps into it
# through a half step (6 7); keys 1-7 are kept out of the moon rim.
size 24 32
color k 0b0814
color W 4a2e1c
color w 8a5a30
color P 86101f
color p 9c2050
color q b85a80
color b c87896
color B 9a6070
color 1 47302a
color 2 2e1813
color 3 28130e
color 4 220e09
color 6 5a3722
color 7 392015
frame rest
